<title>USA: TABLE- Stanley Works Q2 shr loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>TABLE- Stanley Works Q2 shr loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>NEW BRITAIN, Conn. 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Millions of Dollars Except Per Share Amounts)</p>
<p>					Second Quarter    Six Months</p>
<p>				   1997     1996	  1997     1996</p>
<p> Net Sales		  $  673.6$  677.2   $ 1,320.2$ 1,312.5</p>
<p>Costs and Expenses</p>
<p>   Cost of sales	     446.1   453.0	 877.5    882.3</p>
<p>Selling, general and</p>
<p>     administrative	  153.8   153.1	 307.0    302.1</p>
