<p>				   755.1   619.7     1,343.0  1,208.0</p>
<p>Earnings (Loss) before</p>
<p>     income taxes	   (81.5)    57.5	(22.8)    104.5</p>
<p> Income Taxes		 (17.0)    24.9	   5.0     42.3</p>
