<p>     (in thousands)	 88,987  88,825	88,878   88,830</p>
<p>NOTE - Q2 1997 net share includes a charge of $24 million, or $0.16 per share, for transition and other costs, $137 million in restructuring charges, as well as unspecified charge for stock options for the new chief executive officer.</p>
<p>Q2 1996 includes a restructuring charge of $3.8 million.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
